*  User copies and pastes text
Goal: Copy and Paste
.Goal: Start of Selection
..Look at <start-target>
..Point to <start-target>
..Cognitive_processor  verify cursor over <start-target>
..Click down on <start-target> (150 milliseconds) *half of a click
..Ignore <start-target>
.Goal: End of Selection
..Look at <end-target>
..Point to <end-target>
..Cognitive_processor cursor over <end-target>
..Click up on <end-target> (150 milliseconds) *half of a click
..Ignore <end-target>
.Goal: Copy Keystrokes
..Hands to Keyboard
..Keystroke CONTROL
..Keystroke C
.Goal: Point to Destination
* Assuming hand was left on mouse while selecting CTRL+C
..Look at <destination-target>
..Point to <destination-target>
..Cognitive_processor <destination-target>
..Click on <destination-target>
..Ignore <destination-target>
.Cognitive_processor text pasted correctly

        